    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75318104ea9930aa",
      "translationZh": "Grok 现已入驻 Microsoft PowerPoint——无需离开应用，即可将大纲转化为幻灯片、扩充演示文稿，并让叙事更加紧凑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce13dd7cc096dbc0",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们将 Grok 引入 Microsoft PowerPoint。通过演示文稿旁的加载项，你可以使用 Grok 开展研究、撰写并完善幻灯片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a3728567f0846a5",
      "translationZh": "Grok for PowerPoint 正式登场",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac813f5611cc0934",
      "translationZh": "从提示词到 PowerPoint 演示文稿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "063f1cc3230f6e71",
      "translationZh": "向 Grok 提供大纲，即可生成完整的幻灯片演示文稿，其中包含通过网页或 X 搜索获得的研究资料、图表，甚至图像。你也可以与 Grok 协作，只需一条指令，就能添加单张幻灯片、应用样式和主题，或重组各个章节。Grok 会向你提出澄清问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1e3265aca334d42d",
      "translationZh": "研究、撰写与样式设计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1634a94ec9d42f0",
      "translationZh": "Grok 可以帮助你改进样式、让幻灯片的叙事更加紧凑，甚至从网上搜索最新信息。该加载项还可以利用你的 Grok 连接器——你可以让它根据最近的电子邮件，或 SharePoint、Google Drive 中的文件来撰写幻灯片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5f3f1076591711c",
      "translationZh": "Grok for PowerPoint 是一款免费的 Microsoft 365 加载项。从 Microsoft Marketplace 添加它，即可直接在演示文稿中使用 Grok。也提供适用于 Word 和 Excel 的版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
